   🟢 CONTROL: the same params with the same base give the same id (so the difference above is the base) — 03b11784c1
   🟢 newSpace(opts.base) copies {name, sha256, bytes, version} into the genesis params — {"name":"ad_full.db","sha256":"179cd349cedbe5a4146a0f1d67f99d4c61cd03ee4b783d0fd79b4612c3c24fd9","bytes":44937216,"versi
   🟢 a malformed base (sha256 not 64 hex) is refused at newSpace, not silently dropped — newSpace: invalid base (sha256)
